<title>USA: Manhattan votes for reverse spilt.</title>
<headline>Manhattan votes for reverse spilt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manhattan Life Insurance Co said Wednesday its board adopted a plan to acquire the minority interests in the company.</p>
<p>The plan is pursuant to a 1 for 303,784 reverse split of Manhattan Life's outstanding guarantee capital shares and would eliminate minority shareholder interests in Manhattan Life, the company said.</p>
